msgid "Confirm your email address for Qloud"
msgstr "Verify your email address on Qloud"

msgid "Hello,"
msgstr "Hello,"

msgid "Please confirm the email address of your Qloud account by opening this link:"
msgstr "Open this link to verify your email address on Qloud:"

msgid "If you did not create a Qloud account, you can ignore this email."
msgstr "If you did not create a Qloud account, you can ignore this email."

